<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - M.S. Carriers cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - M.S. Carriers cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said it cut its rating of M.S. Carriers Inc to neutral from a buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the Memphis-based truckload carrier fell 1-3/4 to 17-1/4.</p>
</text>
